note Note1 {
  type NOTE
  message "The records and other documents that make up the risk management file can form part of other documents and files required, for example, by a manufacturer ’s quality management system. The risk management file need not physically contain all the records and other documents; however, it should contain at least references or pointers to all required documentation. The manufacturer should be able to assemble the information referenced in the risk management file in a timely fashion"
  reference {
    ISO14971-doc-ref3-5
  }
}

note Note2 {
  type NOTE
  message "The risk management file can be in any form or type of medium"
  reference {
    ISO14971-doc-ref3-5
  }
}

